# Shifts with register operands (page 1 0x10-0x17): the opcode low bits name the destination,
# the shift byte holds the type (bit 7: arithmetic), the direction (bit 6: left), the mode (bits 5:4)
# and the source register (bits 2:0); bit 3 is the low bit of the count.
